The SVG backend and table_format.rs are adapted from franken_markdown 0.7.0,
https://crates.io/crates/franken_markdown/0.7.0, upstream commit
ddbdefd8c35770766838a735c554119ff0ef39e3. The parser, fonts, and layout
remain dependencies on the published crate. Local changes add independent SVG
heading and code typography and colors and adapt imports for this crate.

fmd-font/fonts/test-shaping/FmdShaping.ttf is from fmd-font 0.4.0,
https://crates.io/crates/fmd-font/0.4.0, and supports upstream SVG tests.
Each upstream license is included alongside its corresponding files.
